    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Razorwing Jetfighter",
    "summary": "When this unit is picked to shoot in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), you may [Empower](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain) it by spending 1 Pain token.\n\nWhile it is Empowered, once it has shot, pick 1 enemy unit (not **MONSTERS** or **VEHICLES**) hit by at least 1 of those attacks. It is pinned until your next turn starts. While pinned, a unit subtracts 2 from its Move characteristic and 2 from its **Charge rolls**.",
